Data Content: A6 DF D9 1B 3C 05 8C 47 04 5D B8 AF BF 37 6B 1D 11 75 7F B8 09 AC 9C 98 30 01 F1 A3 FA 1C D2 54
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
